고 하반기 출발선에서 심기일전하기 좋은 때다. 하지만 바캉스 후유증에 몸이 더 방전된 것처럼 무겁기만 하다면 ‘휴가’만 보내고 ‘휴식’을 놓친 게 아닐지. 휴식에 더해 편안히 쉬면서 몸과 마음을 보양한다는 개념의 휴양지는 따로 있다. 눈여겨볼 곳은 충남 태안이다.","date":"2026-08-14T15:30:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2026/08/15/BS2TD5X4NBHFBAIA4RU4YBVGXM/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"0.3㎜ 볼펜으로 하루 15시간 작업… AI 그림에 없는 감동 담아","partialText":"","date":"2026-08-14T15:30:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2026/08/15/4IHTUQVBOFGWPDDY6MGK45VE2U/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"가거도(可居島)를 아시나요?","partialText":"","date":"2026-08-14T15:30:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2026/08/15/3C6IN4MZEJC3LOL5HR3HYICYKY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"“국가 유공자는 왜 무료냐고요?… 그분들, 이미 값을 치렀습니다”","partialText":"","date":"2026-08-14T15:30:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2026/08/15/47CKX377XFDKLBTO2OIJRW753I/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"정성호 장관 ‘수원지검 집단퇴정’ 관련 검사 2명 징계 청구","partialText":"","date":"2026-08-14T08:11:40.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/court_law/2026/08/14/IE3MSADFJFF3FCYQACK6QABXII/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","cat